  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#in">ONLY ONCE IN A WHILE</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger">will you find a</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger"><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#affordability" type="topic" resp="#claude">Bargain Price</seg></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b">on an</hi></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_brand">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#g #smaller">ELECTRICALLY OPERATED</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in"><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">(<unclear>Licensee</unclear>)</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger">Reproducing Piano</hi></hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure xml:id="figure_1" ana="#sitting_woman"><desc>A woman in an evening gown reclining in an armchair beside a grand piano and its bench; a window and a table lamp behind</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/>You know the capabilities of the wonderful
          <lb/>electrically operated <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>—how a per-
          <lb/>son with no musical skill can have the actual
          <lb/>playing of <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11918625X">Hofmann</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118641832">Rachmaninoff</persName>
          <lb/>and many more of the world’s greatest pianists
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#home" type="topic" resp="#claude">in their own home</seg>—<seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">with such fidelity and
          <lb/>exactness</seg> <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#virtual_presence" type="topic" resp="#claude">that the artist himself might be sitting
          <lb/>before the piano</seg>. We used such instruments
          <lb/>for short demonstrations at a few concerts, and
          <lb/>though they are practically new, we offer them
          <lb/>at the special price of</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_price">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#b #in"><hi rendition="#sup">$</hi>1175 up</hi>
          <lb/>Call in and have a demonstration.</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_signature">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#b #i">Ye Olde Firme</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in #larger"><orgName>Heintzman &amp; Co.</orgName></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller #right">LIMITED</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b"><address><addrLine>195 Yonge Street.</addrLine></address></hi></hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_phone">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b"><lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">Please note our</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">new ’Phone Number</hi> <hi rendition="#larger">ELGIN 6201.</hi></hi></ab>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
